section.p:
Settings local to a configuration can be made by getting the ResourceResolver
          from the Configuration, casting it to class ConfigurableResourceResolver,
        and calling its setFeature() method.

section.samp:
AugmentedSource as = AugmentedSource.makeAugmentedSource(new StreamSource(...));
as.addFilter(receiver -> new MyFilter(receiver));
documentBuilder.build(as);

Processor processor = new Processor(false);
Serializer destination = processor.newSerializer(new File("out.xml"));
destination.setOutputProperty(Serializer.Property.INDENT, "no");
Push.Document doc = processor.newPush(destination).document(true);
doc.setDefaultNamespace("http://www.example.org/ns");
Push.Element top = doc.element("root");
top.attribute("version", "1.5");
for (Employee emp : getData()) {
   top.element("emp")
      .attribute("ssn", emp.ssn)
      .text(emp.name);
}
doc.close();

ul.li:
The standard collection finder is used and either (a) the URI uses the (non-standard)
        "jar" URI scheme, or (b) the collection URI ends with .zip, .jar,
        or .docx;
